stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Normal: Component Renders
    Normal --> ErrorDetected: Error Thrown

    ErrorDetected --> SentryReporting: Capture Error
    SentryReporting --> ErrorState: Log Complete

    ErrorState --> ShowFeatureFallback: Feature-Level Error
    ErrorState --> ShowGlobalFallback: App-Level Error

    ShowFeatureFallback --> RetryAttempt: User Clicks Retry
    ShowFeatureFallback --> NavigateHome: User Clicks Home

    ShowGlobalFallback --> PageReload: User Reloads
    ShowGlobalFallback --> NavigateHome: User Clicks Home

    RetryAttempt --> Normal: Success
    RetryAttempt --> ErrorDetected: Failure (max 3 retries)

    NavigateHome --> [*]: Route Change
    PageReload --> [*]: Full Refresh

    note right of ErrorState
        Error captured with context:
        - Component stack
        - User session
        - Breadcrumbs
        - Environment data
    end note

    note right of ShowFeatureFallback
        Less severe UI:
        - Feature name shown
        - Retry option
        - Continue using app
    end note

    note right of ShowGlobalFallback
        Critical UI:
        - Full-page error
        - Reload or go home
        - All data preserved
    end note
